==Description==

The [[Image:Curves_MapOnFace.svg|24px]] '''Curves MapOnFace''' tool maps an object onto a face ...

==Usage==

# Select ..., the target face in the [[3D_View|3D View]], and ....
# There are several ways to invoke the tool:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Curves_MapOnFace.svg|16px]] [[Curves_MapOnFace|Map on Face]]}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Surfaces → [[Image:Curves_MapOnFace.svg|16px]] Map on Face}} option from the menu.
# A '''MapOnFace''' object is created ...

==Notes==

